flowchart TB
    F[Failure] --> A[Analyze Failure]

    A --> R{Retryable?}

    R -->|No| E[Escalate]

    R -->|Yes| B{Retry Budget Remaining?}

    B -->|No| E

    B -->|Yes| C[Add Corrective Context]

    C --> D[Re-plan / Re-execute]

    D --> V[Validate New Revision]

    V -->|Pass| X[Continue Workflow]
    V -->|Fail| F
